      "created_at": "2013-03-16T16:01:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm curious as to how people sort their cards within their boxes/storage solutions. We know one of the &gt;G crew sort theirs alphabetically by set, whereas I prefer mine just alphabetically (heroes, villains and environments split up, naturally). If you do alphabetise, where do you put 'The' decks, with the Ts or elsewhere? And where do you put La Capitan?</p>",
