      "created_at": "2013-03-16T16:35:39.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm not too fancy... I'm using the Delux box so on one side I have all Villains and Enviroments, on the other side all heroes. Nothing is in a specific order but they are more or less clumped together by expansion.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
