      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nal0781/{size}/2041_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-16T16:54:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I alphabetize the \"the\" cards by the second word so The Wraith is alphabetized at W. &nbsp;Won't have Shattered Timelines until next week but I plan to sort La Capitan by L since Spanish is not the game's native language. &nbsp;Also, i seperate heroes, villains and environments.</p>",
