      "id": 55339,
      "name": "Amnachaidh",
      "username": "Amnachaidh",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-03-17T14:17:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"NAL0781\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nal0781/48/2041_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> NAL0781:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I alphabetize the \"the\" cards by the second word so The Wraith is alphabetized at W. &nbsp;Won't have Shattered Timelines until next week but I plan to sort La Capitan by L since Spanish is not the game's native language. &nbsp;Also, i seperate heroes, villains and environments.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>This is also my organizational system.&nbsp; I have it in a large equipment box (Harbor Freight), with the middle section for hp indicators.&nbsp; The oversized villian cards are in a top compartment normally sorted by difficulty.</p>",
